start
:Owner edits shared profile;
note right
No automatic change to existing resume drafts
or published presentations.
Actual submitted documents stay preserved.
end note
if (Owner chooses to review
changes for a resume?) then (yes)
 :Preview source differences
for the intended resume;
 if (Owner explicitly selects
and applies changes?) then (yes)
  :Apply selected changes to that draft
preserve independent text and other resumes;
  if (Owner separately confirms
publication?) then (yes)
   :Publish intended reviewed content;
  else (no)
   :Keep existing published view unchanged;
  endif
 else (no)
  :Keep that draft and live view unchanged;
 endif
else (no)
 :Keep existing resumes and live views unchanged;
endif
